Tool response:
Tool: link_ingredient_to_supplier_with_lot_tracking
Description: Link an ingredient to a supplier with lot tracking enabled.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "ingredient_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Ingredient Id"
        },
        "supplier_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "Supplier Id"
        },
        "lot_tracking_enabled": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "title": "Lot Tracking Enabled"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "ingredient_id",
        "supplier_id",
        "lot_tracking_enabled"
      ]
    }
